source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: vue/directive-values/quotes-in-values.vue
---

# Input

```vue
<template>
	<div :bar='foo("x")'></div>
	<div :bar="'it\'s'"></div>
	<div v-for="x in ['a',b]">{{ x }}</div>
	<div v-for='x in ["a",b]'>{{ x }}</div>
	<div v-for='x in [`say "hi"`]'>{{ x }}</div>
</template>

```


# Formatted

```vue
<template>
	<div :bar="foo('x')"></div>
	<div :bar="'it\'s'"></div>
	<div v-for="x in ['a', b]">{{ x }}</div>
	<div v-for="x in ['a', b]">{{ x }}</div>
	<div v-for="x in [`say &quot;hi&quot;`]">{{ x }}</div>
</template>

```
